# No audio, weights or datasets in the repo. AGENTS.md: never commit real audio,
# voiceprints, keys or held-out evaluation data.
#
# The root .gitignore covers *.wav, *.mp3, *.flac, *.opus and *.amr but not the
# video-container extensions that phone recorders actually produce, so recordings
# arriving as .mp4 or .mpeg were showing up as trackable. This closes that on this
# machine. The root file needs the same patterns for everyone else; raised with R2
# in QUESTIONS.md.

# audio and video containers
*.mp4
*.mpeg
*.mpg
*.m4a
*.aac
*.ogg
*.oga
*.webm
*.3gp
*.wma
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.opus
*.amr

# recordings, datasets and weights live outside the repo
recordings/
data/
datasets/
models/
checkpoints/
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.bin
*.onnx
*.safetensors

# python bytecode (the root .gitignore that should cover this is untracked; see
# QUESTIONS.md). This closes it for ml/ on this machine.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
